From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerson Fernando Budke <gerson.budke@ossystems.com.br>
Subject: [PATCH] [GH#414] Analog: Add STM32L0 ADC driver

Signed-off-by: Gerson Fernando Budke <gerson.budke@ossystems.com.br>

Ported to Renode v1.17.0 STM32_ADC_Common API.

diff --git a/src/Emulator/Peripherals/Peripherals/Analog/STM32L0_ADC.cs b/src/Emulator/Peripherals/Peripherals/Analog/STM32L0_ADC.cs
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/Emulator/Peripherals/Peripherals/Analog/STM32L0_ADC.cs
@@ @@
+//
